% SHARD-ID: RC-02H-DEFINITIONS-GRADED-RAMANUJAN
% SHARD-TITLE: Definitions, Continued: The Ramanujan Property for Graded Transfer Channels
% SHARD-SUMMARY: Sixth definitions shard: graded transfer channel with its even and odd sector restrictions, graded divisor, growth and trivial set, parity-twisted trace preservation and the P-mode.
% SHARD-SUMMARY: Graded RH (one-sided), functional equation, Ramanujan (two-sided) and the manifest Hilbert-Polya form, stated on the divisor so that the same words apply to lattice channels and cMPS generators; graded quantum expanders; the graded Hashimoto operator and graded quantum Ihara zeta; index-two (Clifford) gradings of representation channels.
% SHARD-KEYWORDS: definitions, graded bond, transfer channel, sectors, divisor, trivial set, P-mode, Riemann hypothesis, functional equation, Ramanujan, Hilbert-Polya, quantum expander, Hashimoto, quantum Ihara zeta, Clifford theory, index two
