report/sections/08f_complex_zeta_quantum.tex-233-forbidden transitions; the polynomial vertex collapse is a \emph{building}
report/sections/08f_complex_zeta_quantum.tex-234-phenomenon, and \cref{prop:tetrahedron-obstruction} shows it fails on a
report/sections/08f_complex_zeta_quantum.tex-235-four-vertex sphere. Opposition, not non-incidence, is the building's successor
