|\operatorname{Tr}(A_e^* A_{e_{n-1}}\cdots A_{e_1}A_e)|^2
=|\operatorname{Tr}(A_e^* A_{\bar e_1}\cdots A_{\bar e_{n-1}}A_e)|^2,
